<p class="note">Semgrep hit a timeout or could not fully parse these files, so they may contain issues that are not listed here. Timeouts: rescan with <code>--timeout 120 --timeout-threshold 0</code>. Syntax errors: usually a broken or unused file; fix or delete it.</p>
