<h1>Gitleaks - Secret Scanning Report</h1>
<p>Total findings: <strong>{len(gitleaks_findings)}</strong></p>
<table>
<tr><th>Rule</th><th>File</th><th>Line</th><th>Description</th></tr>
{gitleaks_rows}
